---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import image from '../assets/images/recovery.png';
import { testimonials } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import AppointmentButton from './AppointmentButton.astro';
---
<section class="section canvas" aria-labelledby="recovery-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="recovery-layout">
      <Image src={image} alt="Illustrative scene of a woman enjoying a walk outdoors." width={1000} height={750} widths={[360, 500, 750, 1000]} sizes="(min-width: 1120px) 500px, (min-width: 760px) 45vw, calc(100vw - 48px)" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" class="photo recovery-photo" />
      <div class="split-intro"><h2 id="recovery-title">Get Your Lifestyle Back.</h2><p>If you have been in a car accident, you may be wondering why physical rehabilitation is necessary. After a car accident, physical rehabilitation can help reduce pain, speed recovery, and improve range of motion.</p><p>Immediate treatment of car accident injuries can help you recover more quickly and avoid further injury.</p><AppointmentButton /></div>
    </div>
    <div id="testimonials" class="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testimonials-title">
      <h3 id="testimonials-title">What Our Patients Say.</h3>
      <div class="testimonial-grid">{testimonials.map(item => <figure><Icon name="Quote" size={28} class="quote-icon" /><blockquote><p>“{item.quote}”</p></blockquote><figcaption><span class="initial" aria-hidden="true">{item.initial}</span><span>{item.name}</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
